        <children xmi:type="notation:Shape" xmi:id="_KLUjQLKyEeSZM9DbsSoyxw" type="Note" fontName="Segoe UI" description="Tips and tricks&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;This diagram is located under a Capability, unlike many other dataflow diagrams.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;The content of this diagram has been obtained using the palette tools allowing the insertion of Functional Chain and Scenario elements (the ones of the owning Capability have been chosen).&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Any Function added or created in this diagram is automatically / formally referenced by the owning Capabilty (new reference links created in the model). &#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;The original layout has been copied-pasted from one of the SAB diagrams and adapted." fillColor="13369343" transparency="0" lineColor="6737151" lineWidth="1">
